# Canonicalized author names and emails.
#
# Take a look at the reference (linked below) — but the gist is: the first
# name/email is "canonical" while the second name/email is what we're
# cannonicalizing! To specify multiple names/emails, put one on each line.
# ```
# Proper Name <canonical@email.com> [<commit@email.xx>]
# Proper Name <canonical@email.com> [Commit Name <commit@email.xx>]
# ```
#
# Reference: https://git-scm.com/docs/gitmailmap

# Keep these entries sorted alphabetically.
# In Zed: `editor: sort lines case insensitive`

